)PANEL KEYLIST(ISRHELP,ISR)
)ATTR DEFAULT(%+_)
/*********************************************************************/
/* PANEL    : MBKMENUH                                               */
/* TITLE    : HELP - MEGABANK OPERATIONS DIALOGS                     */
/*-------------------------------------------------------------------*/
/* 2007-02-12 JNB  ORIGINAL                                          */
/* 2013-01-21 PDQ  APPROVAL QUEUE / CUT-OFF RELEASE                  */
/*********************************************************************/
  % TYPE(TEXT) INTENS(HIGH) COLOR(WHITE) SKIP(ON)
  + TYPE(TEXT) INTENS(LOW)  COLOR(GREEN) SKIP(ON)
  ] TYPE(TEXT) INTENS(HIGH) COLOR(YELLOW) SKIP(ON)
)BODY EXPAND(//) WIDTH(80)
%TUTORIAL -/-/- MEGABANK OPERATIONS DIALOGS -/-/- TUTORIAL
%Command ===>_ZCMD                                                             +
+
+These dialogs prepare the control cards read by the batch suite.  They
+replace the paper forms (PC/17, CR/11, FO/4) previously keyed by Operations.
+
]How a card reaches the batch+
+ 1. A user with%key+authority (level K) enters the item.  It is validated
+    against the same rules the batch program uses and saved in the
+    function's pending library <HLQ>.ISPF.PEND.<func>.
+ 2. Where the program needs%four eyes+(product changes, rate changes,
+    charge refunds, suspense write-offs) a%different+user with level A
+    approves it from option%A+.  You can never approve your own item.
+ 3. Approved items are either merged into the batch input straight away
+    (product changes) or%released+at cut-off from option%R+(refunds,
+    suspense, bereavement), or released with the job (rate changes).
+ 4. Every request, approval, rejection, release and submit is written to
+    the audit log <HLQ>.ISPF.AUDITLOG (option%L+).
+
]Cut-off times+
+    Bereavement 18:45 (CFDEC01 19:00).  Refunds / suspense 21:30.
+    No on-request job may be submitted 21:30-05:30 or on a non-business day.
+
]Problems+
+    Authority - your team leader raises form SEC/09 to Security Admin.
+    Anything else - Core Systems Support, ServiceNow group MBK-CORE-L2.
)PROC
  &ZCONT = MBKMENUH
)END
